# backend/
# Server-side application code (Express / Fastify / Next.js API routes).
# This directory consumes core/ via AIService.
#
# Suggested structure:
#   backend/
#   ├── routes/       — HTTP route handlers
#   ├── middleware/   — Auth, rate-limiting, CORS
#   ├── db/           — Database models and migrations
#   └── index.ts      — Server entry point
#
